{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":35,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝懲罰以東"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話又臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要面向西珥山發預言，攻擊它，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["對它說，主耶和華如此說：西珥山哪，我與你為敵，必向你伸手攻擊你，使你荒涼，令人驚駭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我必使你的城邑變為荒場，成為淒涼。你就知道我是耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因為你永懷仇恨，在以色列人遭災、罪孽到了盡頭的時候，將他們交與刀劍，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以主耶和華說：我指着我的永生起誓，我必使你遭遇流血的報應，罪",{"noteId":36},"必追趕你；你既不恨惡殺人流血，所以這罪必追趕你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我必使西珥山荒涼，令人驚駭，來往經過的人我必剪除。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必使西珥山滿有被殺的人。被刀殺的，必倒在你小山和山谷，並一切的溪水中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我必使你永遠荒涼，使你的城邑無人居住，你的民就知道我是耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「因為你曾說：『這二國這二邦必歸於我，我必得為業』（其實耶和華仍在那裏），"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["所以主耶和華說：我指着我的永生起誓，我必照你的怒氣和你從仇恨中向他們所發的嫉妒待你。我審判你的時候，必將自己顯明在他們中間。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你也必知道我－耶和華聽見了你的一切毀謗，就是你攻擊以色列山的話，說：『這些山荒涼，是歸我們吞滅的。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你們也用口向我誇大，增添與我反對的話，我都聽見了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["主耶和華如此說：全地歡樂的時候，我必使你荒涼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你怎樣因以色列家的地業荒涼而喜樂，我必照你所行的待你。西珥山哪，你和以東全地必都荒涼。你們就知道我是耶和華。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":36,"caller":"-","text":"原文是血；本節同","reference":{"chapter":35,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/35.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/36.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/34.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}